{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55788","headline":"上鼓山国师偈兼请师和之（题拟） · 王十八郎","name":"上鼓山国师偈兼请师和之（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无形无本亦无名，日用驱驱不暂停。\n对面向人多不识，纵横自在转分明。\n权时来寄君家宅，万种千般是事能。\n认取当来真本性，一时抛弃事皆行。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王十八郎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}